---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import pfp from "../../public/assets/pfp.jpeg";
---

<section
  class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[#f3f3f3] text-justify w-full max-w-full md:max-w-[50vw] px-4 mx-auto"
>
  <div class="w-full sm:w-[80%] md:w-[70%]">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-start items-center sm:items-center gap-4 sm:gap-5 mb-5">
      <Image
        src={pfp}
        alt="Just Me :D"
        class="w-[180px] h-[180px] sm:w-[150px] sm:h-[150px] md:w-[180px] md:h-[180px] rounded object-cover"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <div class="w-full sm:w-auto">
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-200">Hello!</p>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-200 text-left">
          I'm <i class="">Shubham Thakur</i>. I am a CS Student. I love
          programming, Pokémon, English literature, philosophy, art, nature, and
          music.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 mb-3">
      I am still figuring out what I want to do with my life. But given my
      genuine interest in a lot of subjects, I aspire to deepen my understanding
      of various fields - a persona which translates to being <a
        class="link-dotted"
        href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polymath">Polymath</a
      >. Thus, I aim to produce something meaningful for myself and society.
    </p>
    <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 mb-3">
      If you are interested in browsing my endeavors in Computer Science, visit <a
        class="link-dotted"
        target="_blank"
        href="/cs">this page</a
      >. Visit my résume <a
        class="link-dotted"
        href="/assets/shbhmt.pdf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        here
      </a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Scroll Down Indicator -->
  <div class="mt-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Scroll down</p>
      <svg
        class="mt-2 w-5 h-5 text-gray-400"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
